# G2 — reasoning passthrough + answer anchor (DeepSeek-V4 / Qwen3.x shape).
# The prompt seeds `<think>` open, so token 0 is inside the reasoning span.
# think-tail consumes reasoning unconstrained in the TOKEN domain (any token
# except the close marker — O(log k) membership test in hf2q's TokenNot
# machinery), then forces the analyst-register anchor as the first tokens of
# the *answer* segment, then releases fully. EOG admitted anywhere in body.
# Requires tokenizer-bound parse: `</think>` must resolve to one token id —
# the top-level `grammar` request param takes that path in hf2q.
root       ::= think-tail opening body
think-tail ::= !</think>* "</think>"
opening    ::= "\n"* "I'll analyze this directly.\n\n"
body       ::= [^\x00]*
